WEBVTT

00:34:26.496 --> 00:34:30.079
If you think about it, most
of our Hollywood movies,

00:34:30.579 --> 00:34:37.788
they usually have the protagonists
experiencing a long series of setbacks,

00:34:38.246 --> 00:34:43.538
but then they have stuck to it and
they've refused to admit failure.

00:34:44.163 --> 00:34:48.079
And in fact, everyone around them has told
them that whatever is happening is

00:34:48.079 --> 00:34:52.996
a failure and everyone around them is
dropped off and they have hung in there

00:34:52.996 --> 00:34:54.829
and they are ultimately successful.

00:34:56.079 --> 00:34:58.121
And yeah, grit can be a good thing.

00:34:58.663 --> 00:35:02.704
We need people with the will to persist
and triumph in the face of obstacles.